.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/confirm-mode-checkpointed-execution.md:52:Confirm mode is interactive, approval-gated, and still routes through initialization, loop, synthesis, and save rather than a separate workflow.
