.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/command-flow-stress-tests/setup-yaml-handoff.md:105:| `.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/SKILL.md:86` | command-owned workflow is mandatory |
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/command-flow-stress-tests/pause-sentinel-halt.md:19:Pause handling belongs to the command workflow, not the leaf agent. A stress test must prove the lifecycle stop is represented in JSONL and does not get treated as a successful research iteration.
